msgstr "上传为 {size}，超过 {limit} 的限制；请提高 CR_MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES 以允许它"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/service/managed.py:643
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"not enough free space on the managed workspace disk {root}: {free} free, "
