#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/__init__.py:210
msgid ""
"--tailscale-host / --tailscale-port configure Serve; pass --tailscale too"
" (or set CR_TRUSTED_HOSTS to trust a hostname without Serve)."
msgstr ""
